docs/relay-asset-release-runbook.md:1056:| Reproducible four-target bytes | M2 relay build maintainer | `TASK-260715-24icoz`, `TASK-260715-1q03sa` | native runner owners | Unsigned executable bytes and normalized archive |
docs/relay-asset-release-runbook.md:1058:| Relay notices and relay-scoped inventory/provenance | M2 supply-chain owner | `TASK-260715-vtot05` | M5 compliance | Relay input only; product-wide assembly stays M5 |
docs/relay-asset-release-runbook.md:1059:| Product notices and release SBOM | M5 compliance | `TASK-260715-151xf0`, `TASK-260715-37rtzn` | relay owner | Final containing-product evidence |
