+# TASK-260715-whtdsf — Handoff evidence
+
+Date: 2026-08-30 (Asia/Tbilisi)
+
+## Result
+
+Ready for review. The binding autonomous CI trust and quality-gate draft now
+defines the existing seed workflow migration boundary, every active required
+workflow trigger and job, pull-request trust defaults, protected release
+environments, stable required-check policy, provenance/retention/network rules,
+and deterministic failure semantics for the macOS-first and later macOS/relay
+release paths.
+
+Gate A0 and iOS/TestFlight/App Store remain deferred and are never inferred as
+passes. Existing Linux relay-native hardening is allowed, but no Linux CI runner
+is an architectural prerequisite for the macOS working-client path.
+
+## Outcomes
+
+- `docs/TASK-260715-whtdsf_ci-trust-and-quality-gate-contract.md` — binding
+  contract and full AC/owner/threat traceability.
+- `diagrams/TASK-260715-whtdsf_ci-trust-boundary.puml` — focused trust-boundary
+  source.
+- `diagrams/artefacts/TASK-260715-whtdsf_ci-trust-boundary.svg` — rendered view.
+- `README.md` — CI contract link and PlantUML tool invocation/output contract.
+- `LOGBOOK.md` — binding decisions, scope, missing-reference finding, and
+  ratification boundary.
+
+## Board shape and justified-gap audit
+
+No Story, Task, Bug, research task, or planning snapshot was created. The active
+story already has one atomic owner for every contract, policy, validation,
+release, evidence, and adversarial-test deliverable.
+
+`TASK-260717-1s2eiz` was closed (not deleted) as obsolete. Its intended seed
+workflow already exists at `.github/workflows/ci.yml`; the remaining work maps
+to `TASK-260715-2wjvlx`, `TASK-260715-2hef52`, `TASK-260715-3mk4hs`,
+`TASK-260715-1m3edc`, and `TASK-260715-2ybl7y`. Its board note records the exact
+gap and the Gate A0/Linux/iOS/credentials/implementation out-of-scope checks.
+No unique deliverable or genuine unanswered research question remained.
+
+The contract's exact retention periods, protected-environment names, network
