+| `policy/board-spec` | Same | `contents: read`; no environment; no secrets | Deny | Board/spec validation report; verification/90d | None |
+| `policy/version-release-metadata` | Same; PR evaluates proposed inputs without claiming a release | `contents: read`; no environment; no secrets | Deny | Version/tag/release-note report; verification/90d | None |
