+
+## Acceptance mapping
+
+1. Contract §3 inventories the existing seed and every required active workflow
+   trigger/job with actor trust, input, token, environment, secrets, network,
+   outputs/retention, and approval. Deferred iOS has no active trigger or gate.
+2. Contract §§2–3 bind PR jobs to read-only contents, no production environment,
